iv>\n            <p>\n              <strong>You need to navigate different levels of dress.</strong>\n              Business professional, business casual, presentations,\n              networking and travel all require something slightly different.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-signal\">\n            <div class=\"ycs-signal-icon\">05</div>\n            <p>\n              <strong>You want to look current without looking overly styled.</strong>\n              Polished, capable and appropriate — while still looking like yourself.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- OFFER -->\n  <section class=\"ycs-section ycs-section--soft\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-offer-header\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">\n          One Complete Professional Style Experience\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"ycs-h2\">\n          Your colors and your wardrobe, working together.\n        </h2>\n\n        <p class=\"ycs-body\">\n          The Polished Professional for Men combines personalized color\n          analysis with private wardrobe strategy so you know not only\n          what looks good on you — but exactly how to use that information.\n        </p>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-service-stack\">\n\n        <!-- COLOR -->\n        <article class=\"ycs-service-card\">\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-service-number\">01</div>\n\n          <div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-service-kicker\">\n              Your Color Foundation\n            </div>\n\n            <h3 class=\"ycs-service-title\">\n              Signature Color Analysis\n            </h3>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-service-byline\">\n              Personally performed by Jen Vax\n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"ycs-service-copy\">\n              Discover the colors that work naturally with your complexion,\n              hair and eyes — then use that information to make better decisions\n              about shirts, jackets, ties, knitwear, outerwear and accessories.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-check-grid\">\n\n              <p class=\"ycs-check\">Personalized Color Analysis eBook</p>\n\n              <p class=\"ycs-check\">Digital Color Palette</p>\n\n              <p class=\"ycs-check\">Printed Palette Postcards</p>\n\n              <p class=\"ycs-check\">\n                You draped in your best colors across 5 categories\n              </p>\n\n              <p class=\"ycs-check\">\n                Color pairing guides with styling tips\n              </p>\n\n              <p class=\"ycs-check\">\n                8 curated color combinations\n              </p>\n\n              <p class=\"ycs-check\">\n                Recommendations tailored to your lifestyle\n              </p>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-founder-note\">\n              <strong>\n                A rare opportunity to work directly with the founder of Your Color Style.\n              </strong>\n              Jen personally completes your Signature Color Analysis so\n              your wardrobe begins with an individualized color foundation.\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </article>\n\n\n        <!-- STYLING -->\n        <article class=\"ycs-service-card\">\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-service-number\">02</div>\n\n          <div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-service-kicker\">\n              Your Working Wardrobe\n            </div>\n\n            <h3 class=\"ycs-service-title\">\n              Personal Styling Package\n            </h3>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-service-byline\">\n              With Gail Scott · Includes 4 Zoom Calls\n            </div>\n\n            <p class=\"ycs-service-copy\">\n              Over 90 days, Gail helps you edit, rebuild and organize your\n              wardrobe around your professional role and real life.\n            