ycs-eyebrow\">\n            The Real Goal\n          </div>\n\n          <h2 class=\"ycs-h2\">\n            Open your closet and know exactly what works.\n          </h2>\n\n          <p class=\"ycs-body\">\n            A navy jacket. The right trousers. Shirts in colors that flatter you.\n            Shoes and belts that coordinate. Knits and casual pieces that integrate\n            into the same wardrobe.\n          </p>\n\n          <p class=\"ycs-body\">\n            Instead of owning more, you own pieces that make sense together.\n          </p>\n\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-outcome-list\">\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-outcome-item\">\n              <span class=\"ycs-outcome-mark\">✓</span>\n              <p>\n                A wardrobe aligned with your professional role and lifestyle\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-outcome-item\">\n              <span class=\"ycs-outcome-mark\">✓</span>\n              <p>\n                Colors that make shopping and coordination easier\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-outcome-item\">\n              <span class=\"ycs-outcome-mark\">✓</span>\n              <p>\n                Foundational pieces that work harder together\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-outcome-item\">\n              <span class=\"ycs-outcome-mark\">✓</span>\n              <p>\n                Business professional outfits ready to wear\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-outcome-item\">\n              <span class=\"ycs-outcome-mark\">✓</span>\n              <p>\n                Business casual combinations that still look intentional\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-outcome-item\">\n              <span class=\"ycs-outcome-mark\">✓</span>\n              <p>\n                More confidence in what to buy — and what not to buy\n              </p>\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- PRICE -->\n  <section class=\"ycs-section ycs-section--soft\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-investment-card\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-investment-grid\">\n\n          <div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">\n              The Polished Professional for Men\n            </div>\n\n            <h2 class=\"ycs-h2\">\n              A wardrobe that works as hard as you do.\n            </h2>\n\n            <p class=\"ycs-body\">\n              Your investment includes your Signature Color Analysis\n              personally performed by Jen and Gail's 90-day Personal\n              Styling Package with four private Zoom calls.\n            </p>\n\n          </div>\n\n\n          <div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-investment-price\">\n              $1,297\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-investment-label\">\n              Complete 90-day professional wardrobe experience\n            </div>\n\n\n            <div class=\"ycs-investment-actions\">\n\n              <a href=\"#order\" class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn--primary\">\n                Get The Polished Professional\n              </a>\n\n              <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScSMaoQFgRnaNyTCgKNX2QtS6mTaeRgumr66c6l4DEbOG-5LA/viewform\" class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn--secondary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                Schedule an Info Call\n              </a>\n\n            </div>\n\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- WHO IT'S FOR -->\n  <section class=\"ycs-section ycs-section--white\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-intro\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">\n          Is This For You?\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"ycs-h2\">\n          Designed for men who would rather get it right than keep guessing.\n        </h2>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-fit-grid\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-fit-item\">\n          <strong>\n            Your career or role has changed.\n          </strong>\n\n          <span>\n            Your wardrobe should reflect the level you're operating at now.\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-fit-item\">\n          <strong>\n            You dislike shopping.\n          </strong>\n\n          <span>\n            You want to make fewer, better purchases with a clear plan.\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-fit-item\">\n          <strong>\n            Your wardrobe feels inconsistent.\n          </strong>\n\n          <span>\n            You have individual pieces but not enough dependable combinations.\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-fit-item\">\n          <strong>\n            You want expert guidance.\n          </strong>\n\n          <span>\n            You would rather have someone help you solve the problem correctly\n            than spend more time figuring it out yourself.\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- FAQ -->\n  <section class=\"ycs-section ycs-section--soft\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-intro\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">\n          Frequently Asked Questions\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"ycs-h2\">\n          Before you begin.\n        </h2>\n\n      </div>\n\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-faq\">\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>\n            How long does The Polished Professional for Men take?\n          </summary>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-faq-answer\">\n            The styling portion is designed as a 90-day process. This gives\n            you time to assess your wardrobe, identify what you truly need,\n            make strategic purchases and create useful combinations instead\n            of trying to change everything at once.\n          </div>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>\n            How many private styling calls are included?\n          </summary>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-faq-answer\">\n            Your Personal Styling Package with Gail includes four Zoom calls\n            throughout the 90-day process.\n          </div>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>\n            Do I need to replace my entire wardrobe?\n          </summary>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-faq-answer\">\n            No. Gail will help you determine what already works, what no longer\n            serves you and which foundational pieces would make the biggest\n            difference. The goal is a more useful wardrobe, not simply more clothes.\n          </div>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>\n            Will you help with business casual as well as suits?\n          </summary>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-faq-answer\">\n            Yes. The goal is to build a wardrobe around your actual professional\n            life. That can include traditional business professional clothing,\n            business casual combinations, presentations, meetings, travel and\n            other situations relevant to you.\n          </div>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>\n            Who performs my color analysis?\n          </summary>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-faq-answer\">\n            Your Signature Color Analysis is personally completed by Your Color\n            Style founder Jen Vax.\n          </div>\n        </details>\n\n\n        <details>\n          <summary>\n            What if I'm not sure this package is right for me?\n          </summary>\n\n          <div class=\"ycs-faq-answer\">\n            You can request an information call before purchasing. We'll discuss\n            what you're hoping to change and whether The Polished Professional\n            for Men is the right fit.\n          </div>\n        </details>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n\n  <!-- FINAL CTA -->\n  <section class=\"ycs-final\">\n    <div class=\"ycs-container\">\n\n      <div class=\"ycs-final-inner\">\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-eyebrow\">\n          The Polished Professional for Men · $1,297\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"ycs-h2\">\n          Stop thinking about what to wear. Build a wardrobe that already has the answer.\n        </h2>\n\n        <p class=\"ycs-body\">\n          Give yourself 90 days to create a professional wardrobe\n          that feels polished, capable and distinctly yours.\n        </p>\n\n\n        <div class=\"ycs-btn-row\">\n\n          <a href=\"#order\" class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn--primary\">\n            Begin Your Transformation\n          </a>\n\n          <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScSMaoQFgRnaNyTCgKNX2QtS6mTaeRgumr66c6l4DEbOG-5LA/viewform\" class=\"ycs-btn ycs-btn--secondary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n            Schedule an Info Call\n          </a>\n\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n</div>"
      }
    },
